DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270113
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270114
SUMMARY:Launch: Starliner-1
DESCRIPTION:Atlas V N22 · United Launch Alliance Starliner-1 is the first
  operational flight of a Starliner spacecraft to the International Space 
 Station as part of NASA's Commercial Crew Program. Due to problems with t
 he Starliner spacecraft's RCS attitude control system during the Crew Fli
 ght Test mission in 2024\, this mission has been re-scoped to not carry a
  crew by NASA. It will instead deliver necessary cargo to the orbital lab
 oratory and  Source: Launch Library 2 (The Space Devs).
LOCATION:Cape Canaveral SFS\, FL\, USA
URL:https://ll.thespacedevs.com/2.3.0/launches/07e945c1-2ec6-4d29-a500-1af
 be920440f/
